@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = u100
@actionKey = replace-with-stable-key-for-this-help-action

### 让后端/Agent 识别意图，查询演示设施
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/messages
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","text":"厕所在哪"}

### 二期占位，不声称提供真实健康服务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/messages
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","text":"看看健康服务","intent":"health"}

### 仅转人工事件；无定位/动作 Key 时，不创建求助或实际通知
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/messages
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","text":"找人帮忙","intent":"help"}

### 演示求助工具：会创建 GENERAL 求助和模拟通知，新动作换 Key，重试沿用
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/messages
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Idempotency-Key: {{actionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","text":"我要发起求助","intent":"help","context":{"location":"spot-003"}}
